Module 1: Security Basics
What is Spring Security?

Spring Security is a framework used to secure Spring applications by providing:

Authentication
Authorization
Password Encryption
Session Management
JWT Security
CSRF Protection
Authentication vs Authorization
Authentication

Verifies who the user is.

Username + Password

Example:

admin/admin123
Authorization

Determines what the user can access.

ADMIN -> CREATE USER
USER -> READ USER

